\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O God of love, O King of peace,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0\qj Make wars throughout the world to cease;
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 The wrath of sinful man restrain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Remember, Lord, Thy works of old,
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0   The wonders that our fathers told;
\par  Remember not our sin's dark strain:
\par  Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li360\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Whom shall we trust but Thee, O Lord?
\par \pard\li360\sl202\slmult0 Where rest but on Thy faithful word?
\par None ever called on Thee in vain:
\par Give peace, O God, give peace again.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. Where saints and angels dwell above,
\par \pard\li360\sl202\slmult0 All hearts are knit in holy love;
\par O bind us in that heavenly chain:
\par \pard      Give peace, O God, give peace again.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

